    "long_instructions": "# Denver Air Pollution\r\n\r\nThe program includes the Denver air-pollution dataset.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Load the dataset and print the `head()`.\r\n2. Use `.iloc[]` to replace the missing value with `2004`. Print the `head()` again to verify the update.\r\n3. Filter and print the entries where `Ozone` is less than `330`.\r\n4. Group the data by `Year`. Calculate and print the median `Ozone` for each year.\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help?]\r\n\r\nUse AI Tutor to:\r\n\r\n- View documentation for a pandas function\r\n- Explain unfamiliar code or an error message\r\n\r\nThen use what you learn to write your own code.\r\n\r\n:::",
